  photo__capsule-button__rest-tint-orange: ssimInterior ABSENT: no pixel of the reference silhouette is deeper than 24 CSS px from its contour, so this surface is all band.
  photo__capsule-button__rest-tint-orange: blur NOT MEASURED: the backdrop has no single resolvable step edge inside the silhouette on the x axis, so no edge-spread width is identifiable. Absent, not zero — read interiorStdDev{Native,Web} for the frosting comparison.
